pipe ETH transfers

box alice as Alice
box vault as Vault

hold alice: 2 ETH
hold vault: 0 ETH

step Alice calls with ETH
  say Alice calls the vault and sends 1 ETH along.
  alice -> vault: deposit [value: 1 ETH]

step The call returns
  say The outermost call returns, and the ETH sent becomes final.
  return vault: ok
